---
// Under the hood: the engineering page, rebuilt as a lab. Every diagram is a tiny live demo run
// by site-kit/lab.ts (one rAF loop per visible lab, pooled nodes, transforms only, paused offscreen,
// no autoplay with reduced motion). It opens with where this all started: Bolo.
import UiIcon from './UiIcon.astro';
import Icon from './AbstractIcon.astro';
const { data } = Astro.props;
const kb = (n) => (n / 1000).toFixed(1);
const SKULL = 'M19 6h26v6h7v6h6v6h5v22h-5v6h-8v12h-9v-8h-6v8h-8v-8h-6v8h-8V52H5v-6H0V24h5v-6h6v-6h8ZM11 29v14h15V29Zm26 0v14h15V29Z';
const specs = [
  ['1', 'rAF loop', 'One frame loop drives the whole game.'],
  ['100', 'particle slots', 'Reused, never re-allocated.'],
  ['8,000', 'glyphs indexed', '900 Range reads per refresh, max.'],
  ['32', 'page targets', '160 text containers, chosen by selector.'],
  ['12.5 Hz', 'dirty geometry', '2 Hz once the page is stable.'],
  ['10 Hz', 'HUD updates', 'Separate from the canvas.'],
  ['1.5×', 'canvas DPR cap', 'Sharp enough, never wasteful.'],
  ['24', 'score popups', 'Pooled, like everything else.'],
];
const pipeline = [
  ['src/', 'engine'],
  ['sync:games', 'snapshot + ORIGIN.json'],
  ['game repo', 'test · tag vX'],
  ['games.json', 'hub pin'],
  ['Pages', 'static, no server'],
];
---
<section class="uth" id="engineering" data-lab-page>
  <div class="section-heading"><span class="eyebrow"><span class="index">SYS</span> UNDER THE HOOD / NERD OUT</span><span class="version">SMALL BY DESIGN</span></div>
  <header class="uth-intro">
    <h1>Small games.<br/><em>Serious engineering.</em></h1>
    <p>A webpage is a surprisingly good game map. The trick is reading it cheaply, changing only what you own, and leaving cleanly. Everything below runs on one tiny engine loop, the same way the games do. Poke it. Scroll away and it sleeps.</p>
  </header>

  <!-- 00 ORIGIN: Bolo -->
  <article class="lab origin accent-amber" data-lab="duel" aria-labelledby="origin-title">
    <div class="lab-copy">
      <span class="eyebrow"><span class="lab-no">00</span> INSERT COIN</span>
      <h3 id="origin-title">Two Macs, one network, and Bolo.</h3>
      <p>Middle school engineering tech class: a room of networked Macs and a tank game called <b>Bolo</b>. The gameplay was good for its day. The networking is what hooked me.</p>
      <p>We weren’t always supposed to be playing, but we could reach across the network and change what was happening on someone else’s screen. Once that clicked, I wanted to know how all of it worked, and the way to find out was to build things: apps, websites, games, anything that could talk to something else.</p>
      <p>DOM VIRUS is the same trick, pointed at a webpage: a game that reaches into the page you’re reading.</p>
      <p class="origin-next"><UiIcon name="target" size={16}/> Coming soon: DOM Battlefield multiplayer. Two players, two pages, one battle.</p>
    </div>
    <figure class="lab-stage duel" aria-label="Two computers joined by a network cable. Fire from either side: a packet crosses the cable and hits the other tank.">
      <div class="machine" data-side="0">
        <span class="mac"><span class="crt"><span class="tank-sprite"><Icon kind="tank" size={34}/></span><b class="hit-flash"></b></span><span class="chin"><b></b><i></i></span></span>
        <span class="machine-label">MAC 01 · YOU</span>
        <span class="duel-score" data-score="0">00</span>
        <button class="lab-key" data-fire="0" aria-label="Fire from Mac 01">FIRE</button>
      </div>
      <div class="cable" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><span>THE NETWORK</span></div>
      <div class="machine" data-side="1">
        <span class="mac"><span class="crt mirror"><span class="tank-sprite flip"><Icon kind="tank" size={34}/></span><b class="hit-flash"></b></span><span class="chin"><b></b><i></i></span></span>
        <span class="machine-label">MAC 02<span class="long"> · THEM</span></span>
        <span class="duel-score" data-score="1">00</span>
        <button class="lab-key" data-fire="1" aria-label="Fire from Mac 02">FIRE</button>
      </div>
    </figure>
  </article>

  <!-- 01 THE PAGE BECOMES THE BOARD -->
  <article class="lab accent-cyan" data-lab="board" aria-labelledby="board-title">
    <div class="lab-copy">
      <span class="eyebrow"><span class="lab-no">01</span> THE PAGE BECOMES THE BOARD</span>
      <h3 id="board-title">One host. Two worlds.</h3>
      <p>A custom host attaches a Shadow Root for the canvas and controls, so game UI styles never leak into your page. The board adapter reads real DOM geometry once, caches it, and the simulation plays against that map. Letters and buttons stay in the real document.</p>
      <p>Turn on X-ray to see what the game sees. The bug walks around real elements. Click the button: buttons are enemy factories.</p>
    </div>
    <figure class="lab-stage board" aria-label="A miniature web page. X-ray shows the rectangles a game reads; bugs bounce off them; the button spawns more bugs.">
      <div class="mini-page" data-board>
        <div class="mini-chrome"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span>your.page</span></div>
        <h4 data-solid>Hello, world.</h4>
        <p data-solid>Paragraphs become terrain.</p>
        <p data-solid class="short">Text is cover.</p>
        <button class="mini-button" data-solid data-factory>BUTTON_01</button>
        <div class="xray" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <div class="bugs" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="lab-keys"><button class="lab-key" data-xray aria-pressed="false">X-RAY</button><span class="lab-readout" data-bug-count>BUGS 1 / 6</span></div>
    </figure>
  </article>

  <!-- 02 ONE LOOP. BOUNDED WORK. -->
  <article class="lab accent-lime reverse" data-lab="pool" aria-labelledby="pool-title">
    <div class="lab-copy">
      <span class="eyebrow"><span class="lab-no">02</span> A FRAME, NOT A FREE-FOR-ALL</span>
      <h3 id="pool-title">One loop. Bounded work.</h3>
      <p>One requestAnimationFrame loop. A spatial grid narrows collisions. Bullets, enemies and particles live in fixed pools with hard ceilings, so a long session never grows its memory. Projectiles query cached geometry instead of asking the browser for layout every shot.</p>
      <p>Spawn as much as you like. The pool holds 32: past that the engine says no, and the frame stays inside its budget.</p>
    </div>
    <figure class="lab-stage pool" aria-label="A pool of 32 reusable slots. Spawn particles until the cap rejects new ones; the frame-time meter stays within budget.">
      <div class="arena" data-arena></div>
      <div class="slots" data-slots>{Array.from({ length: 32 }, () => <i></i>)}</div>
      <div class="meter"><span>FRAME</span><b><i data-frame-bar></i><em></em></b><code data-frame-ms>16.7ms</code></div>
      <div class="lab-keys"><button class="lab-key" data-spawn>SPAWN ×8</button><span class="lab-readout" data-pool-readout>ACTIVE 00 / 32 · REJECTED 0 · ALLOCATIONS 0</span></div>
    </figure>
  </article>

  <!-- 03 RECALL -->
  <article class="lab accent-violet" data-lab="recall" aria-labelledby="recall-title">
    <div class="lab-copy">
      <span class="eyebrow"><span class="lab-no">03</span> THE PART WE CARE ABOUT MOST</span>
      <h3 id="recall-title">Recall gives the page back.</h3>
      <p>Hits rewrite characters inside the existing Text node to a literal 0 or 1. No clones, no per-letter wrappers. An ownership ledger records the original and what the game wrote. Recall restores only what is still the game’s; if your app changed it since, your app wins.</p>
      <p>Fire at the sentence, let “your app” edit a hit letter, then Recall.</p>
    </div>
    <figure class="lab-stage recall" aria-label="A real sentence in a text node. Fire turns letters into digits and logs them; App edit changes one; Recall restores only the game's own edits.">
      <p class="victim" data-victim>Hello, world. Same page, different rules.</p>
      <ol class="ledger" data-ledger aria-label="Ownership ledger"></ol>
      <div class="lab-keys"><button class="lab-key" data-hit>FIRE</button><button class="lab-key" data-app-edit>APP EDIT</button><button class="lab-key primary-key" data-recall>RECALL</button><span class="lab-readout" data-owned>OWNED 0</span></div>
    </figure>
  </article>

  <!-- SPEC SHEET -->
  <div class="spec">
    <div class="spec-head"><span class="eyebrow"><span class="lab-no">04</span> SPEC SHEET</span><h3>Hard limits, in actual numbers.</h3><p>Limits constrain work; they are not frame-rate promises. Real frame time still depends on the page, fonts and device.</p></div>
    <ul class="spec-grid">{specs.map(([n, label, note]) => <li class="spec-card"><b>{n}</b><span>{label}</span><small>{note}</small></li>)}</ul>
    <ul class="size-chips" aria-label="Package sizes">{data.games.map((game) => <li class={`accent-${game.accent}`}><i></i><span>{game.name}</span><b>{kb(game.metrics.gzip)}<small> kB gzip</small></b></li>)}</ul>
    <p class="spec-note">Sizes are measured at site build from each package’s distribution files (gzip, decimal kB). Null Invaders caps aliens at 48 and bullets at 80; Byte Runner caps flies at 12; Sherman Bytes caps tanks at 32 and shells at 120; Swarm caps bugs at 48.</p>
  </div>

  <!-- PIPELINE -->
  <article class="lab pipeline-lab accent-amber" data-lab="pipeline" aria-labelledby="ship-title">
    <div class="lab-copy">
      <span class="eyebrow"><span class="lab-no">05</span> INDEPENDENT PACKAGES · SHARED FOUNDATIONS</span>
      <h3 id="ship-title">Build once. Ship each.</h3>
      <p>The engine lives here. Each game gets a fingerprinted snapshot, tests itself and tags its own release. The hub pins exact versions and Pages serves static files: no runtime iframe, no remote content service, no client framework.</p>
    </div>
    <figure class="lab-stage pipeline" aria-label="Release pipeline from engine source to the live site. Ship it sends a release through each stage.">
      <ol class="stages">{pipeline.map(([t, s]) => <li><b>{t}</b><span>{s}</span></li>)}</ol>
      <i class="parcel" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 64 64" shape-rendering="crispEdges"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d={SKULL}/></svg></i>
      <div class="lab-keys"><button class="lab-key" data-ship>SHIP IT</button><span class="lab-readout" data-ship-readout>READY</span></div>
    </figure>
  </article>

  <div class="engine-hud" data-engine-hud data-idle aria-hidden="true"><span class="hud-led"></span><span>ENGINE</span><span>FPS <b data-hud-fps>--</b></span><span><span class="long">ENTITIES</span><span class="short">ENT</span> <b data-hud-entities>0</b></span><span><span class="long">LABS AWAKE</span><span class="short">AWAKE</span> <b data-hud-awake>0</b>/<b data-hud-total>5</b></span></div>
</section>

<style>
.uth{margin:0 auto;padding:44px 30px 30px;max-width:1200px}
.uth-intro{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.1fr) minmax(0,1fr);gap:40px;align-items:end;margin:30px 0 44px}
.uth-intro h1{margin:0;font-size:clamp(40px,6vw,72px);line-height:.98;letter-spacing:-.04em}
.uth-intro h1 em{font-style:normal;color:var(--accent-text,var(--accent))}
.uth-intro p{margin:0;color:var(--muted);font-size:16px;max-width:460px}
.lab{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) minmax(0,1.05fr);gap:clamp(40px,7vw,104px);align-items:center;margin:0 0 clamp(56px,9vw,128px)}
.lab-copy{max-width:500px}
.lab.reverse .lab-copy{justify-self:end}
.lab.reverse .lab-copy{order:2}
.lab-copy h3{margin:10px 0 12px;font-size:clamp(26px,3.2vw,38px);line-height:1.05;letter-spacing:-.02em}
.lab-copy p{margin:0 0 12px;color:var(--muted);font-size:15px;line-height:1.65}
.lab-copy p b{color:var(--ink)}
.lab-no{display:inline-block;margin-right:8px;padding:2px 6px;font:700 10px/1.3 var(--mono);color:var(--accent-ink);background:var(--accent);border:1px solid var(--ink);box-shadow:2px 2px 0 var(--ink);rotate:-5deg}
.origin-next{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;color:var(--ink)!important;font:600 12px/1.4 var(--mono)!important;letter-spacing:.02em}
.origin-next :global(.ui-icon){color:var(--accent-text,var(--accent));flex-shrink:0}
/* The stage: a card in the lab's accent with the site's hard shadow. */
.lab-stage{position:relative;margin:0;padding:18px;background:var(--surface);border:2px solid var(--ink);border-radius:10px;box-shadow:6px 6px 0 var(--accent)}
.lab-keys{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:12px;margin-top:14px}
.lab-key{min-height:38px;padding:8px 14px;font:700 11px/1 var(--mono);letter-spacing:.08em;color:var(--ink);background:var(--surface);border:2px solid var(--ink);border-radius:8px;box-shadow:3px 3px 0 var(--ink);cursor:pointer}
.lab-key[aria-pressed="true"],.primary-key{background:var(--accent);color:var(--accent-ink)}
.lab-key[aria-pressed="true"],.lab-key[aria-pressed="true"]:hover{transform:translate(3px,3px)!important;box-shadow:0 0 0 var(--ink)!important}
.lab-key:disabled{opacity:.45;cursor:default}
.lab-readout{font:600 10px/1.4 var(--mono);letter-spacing:.06em;color:var(--muted)}

/* 00 duel */
.duel{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 70px 1fr;align-items:start;gap:0}
.machine{display:grid;justify-items:center;gap:8px;text-align:center}
.mac{display:grid;width:100%;max-width:170px;padding:9px 9px 0;background:#d9d3c3;border:2px solid var(--ink);border-radius:10px 10px 6px 6px;box-shadow:3px 3px 0 var(--ink)}
.crt{position:relative;display:grid;place-items:center;aspect-ratio:4/3;background:repeating-linear-gradient(0deg,#ffffff08 0 2px,transparent 2px 4px),#0b0a1a;border:2px solid #8f8879;border-radius:6px;color:var(--accent);overflow:hidden}
/* A scrap of a Bolo map: walls, a pillbox and a dot grid. */
.crt::before{content:"";position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(#3d3566,#3d3566) 10% 18%/22% 9% no-repeat,linear-gradient(#3d3566,#3d3566) 10% 18%/7% 30% no-repeat,linear-gradient(#3d3566,#3d3566) 88% 82%/26% 9% no-repeat,linear-gradient(#3d3566,#3d3566) 72% 14%/9% 9% no-repeat,linear-gradient(#ffd16655,#ffd16655) 16% 84%/8% 11% no-repeat,radial-gradient(#ffffff16 1px,transparent 1.5px) 0 0/10px 10px}
.crt.mirror::before{scale:-1 1}
.chin{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;height:24px;padding:0 6px}
.chin b{width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:1px;background:#4bce82;box-shadow:0 0 0 1px #5d574b}
.chin i{width:32px;height:4px;margin-left:auto;border-radius:2px;background:#5d574b}
.tank-sprite{display:block;transition:translate .12s}
.tank-sprite.flip{scale:-1 1}
.tank-sprite :global(svg){display:block;width:44px;height:44px}
.hit-flash{position:absolute;inset:5px;border-radius:6px;background:#ffd166;opacity:0;pointer-events:none}
.machine-label{font:600 9px/1.3 var(--mono);letter-spacing:.08em;color:var(--muted)}
.duel-score{font:700 22px/1 var(--mono);color:var(--ink)}
.cable{position:relative;height:100%;display:grid;place-items:center}
.cable i{position:absolute;left:-4px;right:-4px;top:38%;height:3px;background:repeating-linear-gradient(90deg,var(--ink) 0 6px,transparent 6px 9px)}
.cable span{position:absolute;top:calc(38% + 10px);left:50%;translate:-50% 0;width:90px;text-align:center;font:600 7px/1.3 var(--mono);color:var(--faint);letter-spacing:.05em}
.duel :global(.packet){position:absolute;top:0;left:0;width:11px;height:11px;margin-left:-5px;background:#ffd166;border:2px solid var(--ink);border-radius:2px}

/* 01 board */
.mini-page{position:relative;padding:44px 22px 22px;min-height:250px;background:var(--bg);border:2px solid var(--ink);border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden}
.mini-chrome{position:absolute;left:0;right:0;top:0;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;padding:9px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);font:9px var(--mono);color:var(--faint)}
.mini-chrome i{width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;background:#f4457a}.mini-chrome i:nth-child(2){background:#ffb547}.mini-chrome i:nth-child(3){background:#4bce82}
.mini-chrome span{margin-left:auto}
.mini-page h4{display:inline-block;margin:6px 0 14px;font:800 30px/1 var(--mono);letter-spacing:-.02em}
.mini-page p{width:fit-content;margin:0 0 10px;font-size:14px;color:var(--muted)}
.mini-page p.short{margin-left:80px}
.mini-button{margin-top:10px;min-height:34px;padding:6px 14px;font:700 11px var(--mono);color:var(--ink);background:var(--raised);border:2px solid var(--ink);border-radius:6px;box-shadow:3px 3px 0 var(--ink);cursor:pointer}
.xray{position:absolute;inset:0;pointer-events:none;opacity:0;transition:opacity .2s}
.board[data-xray-on] .xray{opacity:1}
.xray :global(b){position:absolute;border:2px dashed var(--accent);border-radius:3px;background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--accent) 10%,transparent)}
.xray :global(b span){position:absolute;left:calc(100% + 6px);top:50%;translate:0 -50%;padding:1px 5px;font:700 8px/1.3 var(--mono);color:var(--accent-ink);background:var(--accent);white-space:nowrap}
.bugs{position:absolute;inset:0;pointer-events:none}
.bugs :global(i){position:absolute;left:0;top:0;width:20px;height:20px;color:#8573ee;will-change:transform}
.bugs :global(i svg){display:block;width:20px;height:20px}

/* 02 pool */
.arena{position:relative;height:170px;background:repeating-linear-gradient(0deg,#ffffff07 0 2px,transparent 2px 4px),#0b0a1a;border:2px solid var(--ink);border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden}
.arena :global(i){position:absolute;left:50%;bottom:0;width:6px;height:6px;margin-left:-3px;background:var(--c,#4bce82);box-shadow:0 0 8px var(--c,#4bce82);opacity:0;will-change:transform}
.slots{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(16,1fr);gap:4px;margin-top:12px}
.slots i{aspect-ratio:1;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:2px;background:transparent;transition:background .12s}
.slots i:global(.on){background:var(--accent);border-color:var(--ink)}
.pool:global(.capped) .slots{animation:cap-shake .3s}
@keyframes cap-shake{25%{translate:-3px 0}75%{translate:3px 0}}
.meter{display:grid;grid-template-columns:auto 1fr auto;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-top:12px;font:600 9px var(--mono);color:var(--muted)}
.meter b{position:relative;height:8px;background:var(--raised);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:4px;overflow:hidden}
.meter i{position:absolute;inset:0;background:var(--accent);transform:scaleX(.5);transform-origin:left;transition:transform .1s linear}
.meter em{position:absolute;left:50%;top:-2px;bottom:-2px;width:2px;background:var(--ink)}
.meter code{min-width:46px;text-align:right;color:var(--ink)}

/* 03 recall */
.victim{margin:6px 0 16px;font:700 clamp(20px,2.6vw,28px)/1.35 var(--mono);color:var(--ink);overflow-wrap:anywhere}
::highlight(lab-owned){color:#8573ee}
::highlight(lab-app){color:#ffb547}
.ledger{display:grid;gap:4px;min-height:96px;margin:0;padding:10px 12px;list-style:none;font:600 10px/1.5 var(--mono);color:var(--muted);background:var(--bg);border:1px dashed var(--line);border-radius:6px}
.ledger:empty::before{content:"LEDGER EMPTY. FIRE TO OWN A LETTER.";color:var(--faint)}
.ledger :global(li b){color:var(--accent-text,var(--accent))}
.ledger :global(li.app b){color:#c98a14}
.ledger :global(li.back){opacity:.45;text-decoration:line-through}

/* spec */
.spec{margin:0 0 56px}
.spec-head{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) minmax(0,1fr);gap:8px 40px;align-items:end;margin-bottom:20px}
.spec-head .eyebrow{grid-column:1/-1}
.spec-head h3{margin:0;font-size:clamp(26px,3.2vw,38px);line-height:1.05;letter-spacing:-.02em}
.spec-head p{margin:0;color:var(--muted);font-size:14px}
.spec-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr));gap:14px;margin:0;padding:0;list-style:none}
.spec-card{display:grid;gap:2px;padding:16px;background:var(--surface);border:2px solid var(--ink);border-radius:8px;box-shadow:4px 4px 0 var(--accent)}
.spec-card b{font:700 30px/1 var(--mono);letter-spacing:-.02em}
.spec-card span{font:700 10px/1.4 var(--mono);letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--accent-text,var(--accent))}
.spec-card small{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}
.size-chips{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;margin:18px 0 10px;padding:0;list-style:none}
.size-chips li{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:7px 12px;font-size:12px;background:var(--surface);border:2px solid var(--ink);border-radius:999px}
.size-chips i{width:10px;height:10px;border-radius:2px;background:var(--accent);border:1px solid var(--ink)}
.size-chips b{font:700 12px var(--mono)}
.size-chips small{font-weight:500;color:var(--muted)}
.spec-note{margin:0;max-width:820px;font-size:12px;color:var(--faint)}

/* 05 pipeline */
.stages{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(5,minmax(0,1fr));gap:10px;margin:8px 0 0;padding:0;list-style:none;counter-reset:s}
.stages li{position:relative;display:grid;gap:2px;padding:10px 8px;text-align:center;background:var(--bg);border:2px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;transition:border-color .15s,background-color .15s}
.stages li:global(.lit){border-color:var(--ink);background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--accent) 22%,var(--surface))}
.stages b{font:700 11px/1.2 var(--mono);color:var(--ink);overflow-wrap:anywhere}
.stages span{font-size:10px;color:var(--muted)}
.parcel{position:absolute;left:0;top:0;z-index:2;width:22px;height:22px;opacity:0;pointer-events:none}
.parcel svg{width:100%;height:100%;fill:#f4457a;filter:drop-shadow(1px 1px 0 var(--ink))}

.engine-hud{pointer-events:none;position:sticky;bottom:14px;z-index:6;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px 14px;flex-wrap:wrap;width:fit-content;margin:0 0 0 auto;padding:8px 12px;font:600 10px/1.2 var(--mono);letter-spacing:.06em;color:var(--muted);background:var(--surface);border:2px solid var(--ink);border-radius:8px;box-shadow:3px 3px 0 var(--accent)}
.engine-hud .short{display:none}
.engine-hud b{color:var(--ink);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
.engine-hud [data-hud-fps]{display:inline-block;min-width:2ch}
.hud-led{width:8px;height:8px;margin-right:-6px;border-radius:2px;background:#4bce82;box-shadow:0 0 0 1px var(--ink);animation:led 1s steps(2) infinite}
.engine-hud[data-idle] .hud-led{background:var(--line);animation:none}
